com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T02:16:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T02:16:02Z","body":"I think it would be better to ask the plugin to provide the displayed (translated) name itself, probably by a dedicated method.\r\n\r\n- These names are usually short words that most likely depend on the context. For example, \"Script\" here is different from \"Script\" in locale related dialogs.\r\n- A user-defined main screen plugin should be able to customize the translation of its name.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763020877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763043334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102101#issuecomment-2763043334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102101","id":2763043334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ksLIG","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T02:53:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T02:53:41Z","body":"This could be solved by adding context support to Control nodes and using implicit \"MainScreen\" context for main screen buttons.\r\nRight now none of the main screen names exist in the translation, so there is no need to handle it yet.\r\n\r\nAlso plugins can provide translations by adding custom Translations to `godot.editor` translation domain. I use it in my plugin and it works quite well.\r\n\r\nIn either case, `_get_plugin_name()` can already be used to return translated name. I think it only affects button text, so not sure if it can be even accessed in a useful way.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763043334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763492235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102101#issuecomment-2763492235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102101","id":2763492235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kt4uL","user":{"login":"Repiteo"